  "contentHtml": "<p>부정적이고 태클거는 아이들에게도&#160;</p><p>긍정적인 아이들에게도</p><p>&#160;</p><p>공감을 이끌어낼 수 있는 멘트입니다.(오늘 검증 끝냄^^)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>프로젝트 진행 과정이나 토의토론 과정을 진행할 때 적절히 잘 써먹으면</p><p>반목보다 이해, 상대방이 필요한 존재라는 생각을 서로 하게 될 것 같습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0232599c7dcb5e547afcbd839e4b744247cdfaf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0232599c7dcb5e547afcbd839e4b744247cdfaf\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/734131584df90500fd6e661ce4ad9bd3d3ca128f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/734131584df90500fd6e661ce4ad9bd3d3ca128f\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d628dfd7fcf790a142dfb4a2d1eb1f29f21682c9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d628dfd7fcf790a142dfb4a2d1eb1f29f21682c9\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
